        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository cb82426a-de8b-4ca4-beee-e3753f0f0bea).Image",
        "Description": "Ok yeah so basically, I was jorking my peanits in the bathroom during my break like I always do, and then Rickie peaks through the crack in the stall like a flipping weirdo. He went to my boss, Sneha, and told her about it, and now she&apos;s threatening to have me fired? Mobeen and whatever that stupid Guard&apos;s name is overheard the conversation and told everyone in flipping Dubai. I&apos;m now known as the Burg Khalifa Jerker and my family disowned me. So yeah they need to die plz",
        "GameVersion": "8.23.0.0",
        "IsPublished": true,
        "Entitlements": [
            "LOCATION_GOLDEN"
        ],
